0:{"buildId":"9b_ewxcNGnZuQk26srEVM","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","children":[["$","h1",null,{"data-count":"","children":"4. Impact of corn production on rural communities"}],[["$","p","0",{"className":"question","data-count":"","children":["What impacts does corn cultivation cause economically and socially within rural communities at a time when the province’s population is decreasing?"]}],["$","p","1",{"data-count":"","children":["Rural incomes have been on a steady upwards trend. Disposable income rose 5.8 percent in 2025 to 22,188 yuan per person ",["$","span","1",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","hlj25",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#hlj25","children":"HPBS 2026"}]]}]],")"]}],". Farms on the Northeast Plain average 12.8 hectares per person, compared to 2.7 on the North China Plain ",["$","span","3",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","huo",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#huo","children":"Huo et al. 2022"}]]}]],")"]}],", so a profit of about US$436 per hectare aligns with the given data."]}],["$","figure","2",{"className":"photo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/photos/corn-crib-liaoning.jpg","alt":"Harvested yellow corn cobs stacked behind wire mesh in a metal storage crib","width":1400,"height":1050,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":["Harvested corn cobs drying in a family’s storage crib in Gaizhou, Liaoning, in the north-east corn belt, October 2019."," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"credit","children":["Photo: ","Jason M. C. Han",","," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","rel":"license","children":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],", via"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Corns_Harvesting_Storage.jpg","children":"Wikimedia Commons"}],"."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2","3",{"data-count":"","children":"China’s aging population"}],["$","p","4",{"data-count":"","children":["Heilongjiang lost 330,000 people in 2024 ",["$","span","1",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","caixin",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#caixin","children":"Caixin Global 2025"}]]}]],")"]}]," and 280,000 in 2025, and I calculated that its rural population fell by about 370,000 that year due to urbanisation (a rise from 68.05 to 68.98 percent according to ",["$","span","3",{"className":"cite","children":["",[["$","span","hlj24",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#hlj24","children":"HPBS (2025)"}]]}]],""]}]," and ",["$","span","5",{"className":"cite","children":["",[["$","span","hlj25",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#hlj25","children":"HPBS (2026)"}]]}]],""]}],") and people chasing opportunities in larger cities. More than half of the province’s primary schools have closed in a decade ",["$","span","7",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","caixin",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#caixin","children":"Caixin Global 2025"}]]}]],")"]}],", this plays into a feedback loop where the younger population leaving the region causes a decrease in the government facilities needed by that younger population which in turn causes more young people to leave."]}],["$","p","5",{"data-count":"","children":["On the northeast plain, 40.3 percent of farmers surveyed were over 54 and only 10.6 percent were under the age of 35 ",["$","span","1",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","huo",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#huo","children":"Huo et al. 2022"}]]}]],")"]}],". In Lishu County in the neighbouring Jilin province (the region with second highest corn production as seen in the choropleth map), the average farmer surveyed was 58 ",["$","span","3",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","yu",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#yu","children":"Yu et al. 2025"}]]}]],")"]}],"."]}],["$","figure","6",{"className":"photo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/photos/jiansheng-village.jpg","alt":"Aerial view of a small village of houses and gardens in a neat grid, surrounded on all sides by large green fields","width":1600,"height":1066,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6"],"$undefined"]}],"$L7"],["$L8"],"$L9"]}],"isPartial":"$@a","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lc","isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":"$10"},{"rsc":"$L11","isPartial":"$@12","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@13","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@14"}
